---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/legal-pages.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Siryus Hub"
  description="How Siryus Creative Media Ltd handles personal data for visitors to siryushub.com."
  noIndex={true}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-page__meta legal-page__meta--top">Last updated: March 2025</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Siryus Creative Media Ltd, incorporated in Nigeria, operating at siryushub.com. Contact: management@siryushub.com
    </p>

    <h2>What data we collect</h2>
    <p>
      Name and email when you use our contact form or newsletter signup. No payment data is collected on this site.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <p>
      To respond to your enquiry, to send newsletter updates if you opted in, and to improve our services. We do not sell your data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses minimal cookies for functionality. We do not run advertising cookies or third party tracking.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can request to see, update or delete your data at any time by emailing management@siryushub.com
    </p>

    <h2>Third party services</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Sanity (content management) and may use analytics tools in the future. These services have their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top of this page reflects the last update.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
